{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"type": "tool_result", "tool_use_id": "toolu_f47778d3cffd42cca33e", "content": "     1\tfrom app.db import db\n     2\tfrom app.stripe import capture\n     3\t\n     4\t\n     5\tdef handle_payment_succeeded(event):\n     6\t    order = db.orders.get(event[\"data\"][\"order_id\"])\n     7\t    capture(order.payment_intent)\n     8\t    order.status = \"paid\"\n     9\t    db.orders.save(order)"}]}, "cwd": "/home/dev/code/payments-api", "sessionId": "68969d63-3984-4bbf-a591-a0175931b122", "gitBranch": "main", "timestamp": "2026-11-02T17:12:24.936458Z", "uuid": "c02f4486-e2d8-4ec9-a2f0-f5634de920a6"}
{"type": "assistant", "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "Both incidents: Stripe retried after 30s because the handler was slow, and the handler has no memory of events it already processed, so the retry captures again. Two layers needed: (1) skip events we've seen, keyed by Stripe's event id, (2) skip orders that are already paid. Checking order.status alone races if two deliveries run at once, so record the event id inside the same transaction."}]}, "cwd": "/home/dev/code/payments-api", "sessionId": "68969d63-3984-4bbf-a591-a0175931b122", "gitBranch": "main", "timestamp": "2026-11-02T17:12:24.936497Z", "uuid": "3b8c9b70-9c8f-4fe3-8882-54ff159dc762"}
{"type": "assistant", "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_608ec5d444a54d85b04f", "name": "Edit", "input": {"file_path": "/home/dev/code/payments-api/app/webhooks.py", "old_string": "def handle_payment_succeeded(event):\n    order = db.orders.get(event[\"data\"][\"order_id\"])\n    capture(order.payment_intent)\n", "new_string": "def handle_payment_succeeded(event):\n    # Stripe retries any delivery that takes over 30s; the same event can arrive twice.\n    with db.transaction():\n        if not db.processed_events.add(event[\"id\"]):\n            return  # already handled\n        order = db.orders.get(event[\"data\"][\"order_id\"], for_update=True)\n        if order.status == \"paid\":\n            return\n        capture(order.payment_intent)\n"}}]}, "cwd": "/home/dev/code/payments-api", "sessionId": "68969d63-3984-4bbf-a591-a0175931b122", "gitBranch": "main", "timestamp": "2026-11-02T17:12:24.936621Z", "uuid": "5455b008-1c40-41da-949a-ed782ae5f43c"}
